# This repository publishes only the hybrid book-course branches, the MeTTa
# course, and the exercises and code courses they point at. The rest of this
# local learning lab (vendored tools, other people's book sources, cloned course
# repos) stays out.
/*
!/ml-hybrid
!/hakin-hybrid
!/blck-hybrid
!/security-exercises
!/metta-book
!/metta-course-exercises
!/portal-index.md

# metta-book publishes the book source, its listings and its offline checker.
# The rendered site is generated, and grind.txt is a private two-year plan.
metta-book/book/
metta-book/grind.txt
metta-book/listings/*.output

# metta-exercises is a clone of XBennyX2/Exercises-Metta (a foreign origin and a
# foreign licence). The local work layered on top of it is published from
# metta-course-exercises instead, which this repo deliberately does not contain.
metta-exercises/
